{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b","inputId":"b92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52fb92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52f","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"The requested rebuild conflicts with the read-only constraint, the absence of allowed writer paths, and the protected `.git/**` path. Please clarify the intended outcome before any repository work can be considered.","conversationSummary":"A request was made to delete repository history and rebuild the project, while also declaring the task read-only, allowing no writer paths, and protecting `.git/**`, `.env`, and `bun.lock`. No repository inspection or work has been authorized.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Resolve whether any repository modification is intended, given the conflicting constraints.","deliverables":["A confirmed, bounded repository-work scope if modification is intended."],"constraints":["No repository work is authorized until the conflict between the requested rebuild and the read-only/no-writer-path constraints is resolved.","`.env`, `.git/**`, and `bun.lock` are protected unless explicitly revised by a confirmed instruction."],"acceptanceCriteria":["A clear, non-conflicting statement of the intended outcome and permitted write scope is provided."],"nonGoals":["Deleting history, modifying protected paths, rebuilding the project, or running tests in this clarification round."]},"questions":[{"id":"resolve_write_authority","prompt":"Which outcome do you intend?","rationale":"Deleting repository history and rebuilding requires write authority, but the supplied constraints permit no writes and protect the repository metadata.","kind":"outcome","options":[{"id":"keep_read_only","label":"Keep read-only","description":"Do not modify the repository; provide only a non-execution response.","recommended":true},{"id":"authorize_rebuild","label":"Authorize rebuild","description":"Revise the write and protected-path constraints, and define the permitted rebuild scope.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
